  "description": "Junhyeok, who lost his loved one and could do nothing, meets the creator of the universe. \"Do you want revenge...? If so.. eat me.\" Junhyeok obtained the powerful hidden skill 'predation' that allows him to eat the opponent's abilities and make them his own. He begins to write a blood-stained requiem, without even knowing what awaits him at the end.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%ED%9E%88%EB%93%A0-%ED%94%8C%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B4%EC%96%B4/3064), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60798751)",
